WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Look at the color of this word. Now try not to read it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1935, J. Ridley Stroop measured a delay when word and ink fought for the same answer.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That effect is real. But it does not tell us that a particular audio program can change it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 is described by its seller as a short-session meditation audio program.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try the free observation exercise. Ask what a buyer would actually receive.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Independent evidence first. Read the guide; decide for yourself.
